      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 600,
        "height": 200,
        "content": "## MCP - Transcriber\n\n**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/video-transcription\n\n**Parameters:**\n- `videoUrl` (required*): URL of video to transcribe\n- `videoBase64` (required*): Base64 encoded video\n- `language` (optional): Output language\n- `model` (optional): gemini-2.5-flash (default)\n- `execution_mode` (optional): online | offline\n- `callback_url` (optional): URL for async callback (RFC-040)\n- `job_id` (optional): Custom job ID for async mode"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-note-async",
      "name": "Async Flow Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 400,
        "height": 120,
        "content": "## Async Callback Pattern (RFC-040)\n\nWhen `callback_url` is provided:\n1. Responds immediately with 202 Accepted\n2. Processes in background\n3. POSTs result to callback_url with HMAC signature"
      }
    }
